# Testing

Vitest. Critical paths: fee calculator, queue estimator, sniper timing, broker DTO validation, time-sync offset.

- Pure math tests live next to `packages/core`
- Backend e2e covers config, brokers, sniper start/stop, and throttling
- Frontend Vitest lives in `apps/frontend/test`: secret masking, Zod rejection, `/api`-only client, and the armed disarm control
- Do not hit live broker or TSE hosts in tests. Use fixtures. No Playwright or Cypress
